600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u40"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51f2cd04-a5a0-4e81-8dd2-18a07adfa0d1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"古い outputter/buffer は outputter/buffer_legacy と言う名前で残っているので、最悪こちらに名前を変えると以前のように動く","ts":"1621993065.012800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a=Yh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e48f085f-ebf3-4a48-ad24-a3d9c8097f3c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ありがとうございます、migrate guideとかあれば便利かもですね","ts":"1621993046.012400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h=jpW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f524af3-6924-418f-b57e-e5fad99c95d3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"恐らく…","ts":"1621993031.011900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vWm4E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c13df9c2-9513-4f5c-a2c9-ea170b6474b0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"breaking changeってこれくらいです？","ts":"1621993024.011700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ihCka"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89f5466d-6397-41e3-8320-aedfef18b42c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"実は outputter/buffer は完全にスクラッチで作り直してます。おかげで cmdwin にいても結果が出るようになった","ts":"1621993008.011300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iRzs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d87b0b36-16ea-4847-b326-bba138cda6af","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```\\   'outputter/buffer/opener': ':botright 15split',```\nでいけたっぽい","ts":"1621993001.011100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UPqsc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50fc0905-98a1-4775-941a-fa26541c5396","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`:xxx バッファ名` の `:xxx` に当たるコマンドを書けば OK","ts":"1621992951.010200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rvat"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e679138c-d056-4545-a977-a540b99198dd","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"見てきます、キーワードが分かったので楽そう","ts":"1621992935.009800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/kV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a8aa277-882c-4e73-ac39-77833b909e7e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"doc読まないとか","ts":"1621992926.009300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IXnMi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e1ef800-58c1-4864-abeb-eee6313c828a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"opener というオプションになりました","ts":"1621992916.009000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Dm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a1e8a16-c4d8-40a2-868f-238b8e82e9b1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"です","ts":"1621992894.008700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EBVKg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02196b09-1c33-47bd-b1d9-93530f36d002","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"効かない…あー split の部分です? そこは変わりました","ts":"1621992889.008400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fbu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e48827f4-b8d9-470f-82d3-db196c275555","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"具体的にはbotright 15splitが適用されてなくて普通のsplitで出たりしています","ts":"1621992887.008200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PVd=O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bbf159f-4897-41a7-b68a-92619354f54f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c@U03C71D7H\u003e quickrunで\n```\\ '_' : {\n\\   'outputter' : 'error',\n\\   'outputter/error/success': 'buffer',\n\\   'outputter/error/error': 'quickfix',\n\\   'outputter/buffer/split': ':botright 15split',\n\\   'outputter/buffer/close_on_empty' : 1,\n\\ },```\nが効かなくなってて多分devを取り込んで変わったんじゃないかと予想してるんですが、この辺の変更についてどう変わったか書いてるものってありますか？\n（違ってたらごめんなさい）","ts":"1621992843.007500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1yqx"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U022B9REYK0","text":"\u003c@U022B9REYK0\u003e has left the channel","ts":"1621992195.006100","subtype":"channel_leave","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
